I've loved animals since I was a little girl, but my parents are busy at work all

77
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:18,960
day and I'm at school until 5 p.m.

78
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:25,480
This is why every time I asked to get a pet, they said no.

79
00:11:26,500 --> 00:11:30,200
Things changed on a rainy day a few years ago.

80
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:37,420
I was coming back from school with my best friend when we saw a rubbish bin move.

81
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:44,480
There was a black bag inside and when she took it out and opened it, I saw a little

82
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:51,100
dog. I think it was less than a month old because some of its teeth were still

83
00:11:51,100 --> 00:11:57,260
missing. The dog looked sad and hungry, so I took it home.

84
00:11:58,500 --> 00:12:04,640
While I was waiting for my parents to get back, I gave the dog some meat and water.

85
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:10,500
The dog drank the whole bowl of water, but it didn't eat anything.

86
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:14,980
Then it lay down on the carpet in the living room and slept.

87
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:19,920
When my parents got home, they were surprised.

88
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:26,600
My father sat down on the sofa and the dog jumped onto his legs.

89
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:30,860
Tina, how cute the dog is.

90
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:35,420
Dad smiled and said, touching its head.

91
00:12:36,660 --> 00:12:41,040
My mother went into the kitchen and came back with some meat.

92
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:44,480
This time the dog ate it.

93
00:12:45,140 --> 00:12:48,520
Then she asked me to choose a name for it.

94
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:56,120
She also said if I wanted to keep the dog, I would have to look after it every day.

95
00:12:57,300 --> 00:13:00,320
We have had Lucky for four years now.

96
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:05,500
She's part of my family and we all love her.

